description	"Anakin Skywalker

The Chosen One, prophesized to bring balance to the Force. A Jedi with exceptional strength in all areas.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Yellow/Red/Purple)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense/Deflect (2)
-- 42/25% less Red/Purple damage
-- 35% more special damage
-- EX Saber Throw (1) ^3[CS1]
--- 50% more damage

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (3)
- Pull (2)
- Sense (2)
- Rage (1) ^3[CS4]
- Grip (2) ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- Healing (1)
- Force Block/Focus (2)
- Fury (1)"